{"about_the_game":"<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437930/extras/2_header_ROCKETS,_PAPER,_SCISSORSd.png?t=1712653594\" /><br>Each of the 4 classes in the game maintain a rock-paper-scissors style relationship with each other:<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437930/extras/Gif_KFFIb.gif?t=1712653594\" /><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437930/extras/Gif_LayerCombatb2.gif?t=1712653594\" /><br><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437930/extras/4_header_MIX___MATCHd.png?t=1712653594\" /><br>Bring a team of 4 units, of any class and combination into each mission!<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437930/extras/4_MixandMatch.png?t=1712653594\" /><br><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437930/extras/5_header_COVER___TERRAIN_MECHANICSd.png?t=1712653594\" /><br>The HUD allows players to quickly see how terrain and cover is affecting them in battle.<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437930/extras/Gif_Pilot_Tacpanelb.gif?t=1712653594\" /><br><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437930/extras/6_header_CUSTOMISATIONd.png?t=1712653594\" /><br>Vertical Fighters features different ways of customising your units to better fit your playstyle!<br>Each customisation option changes your <strong><i>&quot;Power&quot;</i></strong>:<br><br>1. The greater the bonus offered, the more <strong><i>Power</i></strong> will be added to your unit's total.<br>2.  A unit with lower Power will have a shorter recovery time compared to a higher <i><strong>Power</strong></i> unit.<br>3.  If your enemies kill you, they are awarded the <strong><i>Power</i></strong> of your unit in the form of points.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437930/extras/6_CustomisationA.png?t=1712653594\" /><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437930/extras/6_CustomisationB.png?t=1712653594\" /><br><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437930/extras/3_header_UNIT_CLASSES.png?t=1712653594\" /><br>Take control of 4 distinct classes of units and engage in inter-layer combat in the air and on the ground. And yes, as huge nod to arcade SCHMUPS you can even play as a stationary turret and still be a killer!<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437930/extras/3_Unittypes.png?t=1712653594\" /><br><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437930/extras/8_header_VARIANTS!d.png?t=1712653594\" /><br>Many units come with variants in <strong>(A)</strong>ttack, <strong>(U)</strong>tility or <strong>(D)</strong>efense specialities. Each variant has an increased number of abilities over their standard form. Each new ability increases the unit\u2019s <strong><i>Power</i></strong> rating. The examples below are of the Helicopter Gunship:<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437930/extras/8_Variants.png?t=1712653594\" /><br><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437930/extras/7_header_CAMOUFLAGE!d.png?t=1712653594\" /><br>Equip a variety of different Camouflage to adjust the way you play! Each one offers its own set of bonuses. Below are some examples of camouflages in matching terrain.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437930/extras/7_Camouflage.png?t=1712653594\" /><br><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437930/extras/9_header_PILOTS!d.png?t=1712653594\" /><br>Pilots offer a way to change the many stats of your units, directly affecting their handling and performance. The more powerful the bonus stat, the higher the <strong><i>Power</i></strong> rating. There are even some pilots that offer negative modifiers, allowing a shrewd player to lower their Power rating (and recovery time) in return!<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437930/extras/9_Pilots.png?t=1712653594\" /><br><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437930/extras/10_header_THE_POINT_OF_POWERd.png?t=1712653594\" /><br><br>If you play as a weaker unit, you have a lower <strong><i>Power</i></strong> rating but you are also 'worth' less points when killed! Conversely, playing as a more powerful unit makes you 'worth' more to your enemies!<br><br>This allows a player to flex the Underdog fantasy if they have the skills, and still be rewarded for it. Or simply feel like a miniboss in the spirit of classic shoot-em-ups!<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437930/extras/Gif_FFA_Steam.gif?t=1712653594\" /><br><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437930/extras/11_header_PERSONALISED_EMBLEMd.png?t=1712653594\" /><br>Assemble and colour your own personalised emblem! Give your opponents something to remember you by.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437930/extras/11_PersonalisedEmblem.png?t=1712653594\" /><br><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437930/extras/13_header_ASYMMETRIC_MULTIPLAYERd.png?t=1712653594\" /><br>Join up to 3 other human players, as you tackle missions co-op or go head-to-head in deathmatch with up to 8 AI bots!<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437930/extras/13_Asymmetric_Multiplayer.png?t=1712653594\" /><br><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437930/extras/14_header_DAILY_LEADERBOARDSd.png?t=1712653594\" /><br>Always have a shot at first place! Look forward to seeing your callsign on the leaderboards!<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437930/extras/14_DailyLeaderboards.png?t=1712653594\" />","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2437930?t=1712653594","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437930/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1712653594","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437930/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1712653594","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437930/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1712653594","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437930/extras/2_header_ROCKETS,_PAPER,_SCISSORSd.png?t=1712653594\" /><br>Each of the 4 classes in the game maintain a rock-paper-scissors style relationship with each other:<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437930/extras/Gif_KFFIb.gif?t=1712653594\" /><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437930/extras/Gif_LayerCombatb2.gif?t=1712653594\" /><br><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437930/extras/4_header_MIX___MATCHd.png?t=1712653594\" /><br>Bring a team of 4 units, of any class and combination into each mission!<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437930/extras/4_MixandMatch.png?t=1712653594\" /><br><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437930/extras/5_header_COVER___TERRAIN_MECHANICSd.png?t=1712653594\" /><br>The HUD allows players to quickly see how terrain and cover is affecting them in battle.<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437930/extras/Gif_Pilot_Tacpanelb.gif?t=1712653594\" /><br><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437930/extras/6_header_CUSTOMISATIONd.png?t=1712653594\" /><br>Vertical Fighters features different ways of customising your units to better fit your playstyle!<br>Each customisation option changes your <strong><i>&quot;Power&quot;</i></strong>:<br><br>1. The greater the bonus offered, the more <strong><i>Power</i></strong> will be added to your unit's total.<br>2.  A unit with lower Power will have a shorter recovery time compared to a higher <i><strong>Power</strong></i> unit.<br>3.  If your enemies kill you, they are awarded the <strong><i>Power</i></strong> of your unit in the form of points.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437930/extras/6_CustomisationA.png?t=1712653594\" /><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/243793