e powerful the bonus stat, the higher the <strong><i>Power</i></strong> rating. There are even some pilots that offer negative modifiers, allowing a shrewd player to lower their Power rating (and recovery time) in return!<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437930/extras/9_Pilots.png?t=1712653594\" /><br><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437930/extras/10_header_THE_POINT_OF_POWERd.png?t=1712653594\" /><br><br>If you play as a weaker unit, you have a lower <strong><i>Power</i></strong> rating but you are also 'worth' less points when killed! Conversely, playing as a more powerful unit makes you 'worth' more to your enemies!<br><br>This allows a player to flex the Underdog fantasy if they have the skills, and still be rewarded for it. Or simply feel like a miniboss in the spirit of classic shoot-em-ups!<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437930/extras/Gif_FFA_Steam.gif?t=1712653594\" /><br><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437930/extras/11_header_PERSONALISED_EMBLEMd.png?t=1712653594\" /><br>Assemble and colour your own personalised emblem! Give your opponents something to remember you by.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437930/extras/11_PersonalisedEmblem.png?t=1712653594\" /><br><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437930/extras/13_header_ASYMMETRIC_MULTIPLAYERd.png?t=1712653594\" /><br>Join up to 3 other human players, as you tackle missions co-op or go head-to-head in deathmatch with up to 8 AI bots!<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437930/extras/13_Asymmetric_Multiplayer.png?t=1712653594\"